Keep a shared word as empty text.
Keep a shared pal as 0.
To test from left (a whole number) with right (a whole number).
If left is at least right, return.
If character left of word is not character right of word, set pal to 0, return.
Test from left plus 1 with right minus 1.

The source is "aacecaaa".
The copy is a copy of source.
Set word to copy.
The last is the last position of source.
The best is 1.
For every step from 0 to last.
The length is last plus 1 minus step.
The right is length minus 1.
Set pal to 1.
Test from 0 with right.
If pal is 1, set best to length, break.

The front is empty text.
The count is last plus 1 minus best.
For every step from 0 to count minus 1.
The spot is last minus step.
Place character spot of source into front.

The result is a copy of front.
For every spot from 0 to last.
Place character spot of source into result.

Show result.
